      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\nもちろん協力はしたいんだが……。\r\nひとつ心配なことがあってな。",
        "official_en": "Sure, I’d be delighted to offer my services, but...there’s something we need to address first.",
        "real_en": "Sure, I'd be happy to help, but... there's something I'm worried about."
      },
