        "official_en_sha256": "f37c132c16b11f730c3d0c3f526e244479986cf66bad88bf7d68df3f553bd90b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "イビルプラントを４体倒せば\r\nチョコボの解毒剤が必要な分だけ作れる。",
        "official_en": "If you can slay four human traps, that should be enough to make all the antidote I need.",
        "real_en": "If you can slay four evil plants, that should be enough to make all the antidote I need."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      },
