      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "グランポート周辺の平原に\r\nイビルプラントはいるはずだ。",
        "official_en": "As your friend there mentioned, you should be able to find human traps in the plains around Grandport.",
        "real_en": "As your friend there mentioned, you should be able to find evil plants in the plains around Grandport."
