        "key": "SubEv_C01_Zairu_02_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_02:SubEv_C01_Zairu_02_005:0c6b3cc4",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_02:SubEv_C01_Zairu_02_005:0c6b3cc4",
        "jp_sha256": "d322d0215721ac7a2b90e943306ee16a4dab41444a253212819fb78dbc2dd500",
        "official_en_sha256": "fa6351580a46ebbf3429cf52328b6647ee56ba9768f60095cdaddee8329805ad"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "チョコボが毒におかされてもすぐ処置できるように\r\n専用の解毒剤を作っておきたいんだが……。",
        "official_en": "So I’d like to have some specialized antidotes handy in case they get poisoned.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
